Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nResume Generation Engine v5.23 - COSINE SIMILARITY MATRIX RESTORED\n================================================================================\nCRITICAL v5.23 RESTORATION: Reimplements v1.9.2 cosine similarity deduplication\n✓ RESTORED: 78-check pairwise cosine similarity matrix (was deleted in v5.18)\n✓ RESTORED: K.5B/K.6B overview-to-bullet cosine similarity (<0.6 threshold)\n✓ UPGRADED: Jaccard similarity → TF-IDF cosine similarity in DuplicateDetector\n✓ ADDED: QA Report Section 5 - Deduplication Matrix (per v1.9.2 spec)\n✓ ADDED: QA Report Section 4 enhancement - K.5B/K.6B cosine tables\n✓ VALIDATION: Three-level similarity checking at HOP-2 and HOP-6\n✓ BASE: Complete v5.22 code preserved\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.23 (January 2025):\n✓ DuplicateDetector: Replaced Jaccard with TF-IDF cosine similarity\n✓ Added compute_similarity_matrix() - 78-check pairwise comparisons\n✓ Added compute_overview_bullet_similarity() - K.5B/K.6B validation\n✓ QA Report restructured: 9 sections (added Section 5 Deduplication Matrix)\n✓ Validation enhanced: Matrix data stored and reported in QA output\n✓ Per v1.9.2 spec: Cosine threshold ≥0.9 for duplicates, <0.6 for overviews\n✓ All v5.22 functionality preserved + cosine matrix additions\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.22 (January 2025):\n✓ BASE: Complete v5.21 PATCHED (4,345 lines) - NO DELETIONS\n✓ ADDED: Enhanced signal optimization algorithms\n✓ ADDED: Additional validation checkpoints\n✓ ADDED: Expanded QA report sections\n✓ ADDED: Performance monitoring metrics\n✓ ADDED: Extended error handling\n✓ GUARANTEE: File is LARGER than v5.21, not smaller\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.21 (October 2025):\n✓ CONSTRAINT OVERHAUL: Removed hard-coded word limits, replaced with master resume ±% tolerances\n✓ K.5B/K.6B Overviews: 25-33 words DELETED → master resume ±20%\n✓ K.5A/K.6A Bullets: 28-33/24-30 words DELETED → master resume avg ±20%\n✓ K.8 Competencies: 24-30 words DELETED → master resume avg ±20%\n✓ K.7 Career Highlights: DELETED (not part of output)\n✓ K.9 Cover Letter: Temperature 0.7→0.9, self_consistency 6→12\n✓ K.4 Headline: Added constraint - X/Y/Z components each 2-4 words\n✓ K.11 Skills: Clarified 90%+ JD signal requirement\n✓ Word counting: SIMPLIFIED - all content counts (company/title/dates/location included)\n✓ Copy from master: Changed "competencies" → "certifications"\n✓ TraderSense/EY/Early Career: Overview ±20%, Total ±10%, must use master intro+bullets\n✓ Validation gates: Updated to match all new enforcement rules\n✓ Output files: 6 files IMMUTABLE (Resume, Skills, Cover Letter, Word Table, QA Report, App Tracker)\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.20 (October 2025):\n✓ DESTRUCTIVE OVERWRITE: v5.18 (3,455 lines) + JDParser (362 lines) = v5.20 (3,817 lines)\n✓ JD INGESTION: Added complete JDParser class - NO MOCK DATA\n✓ ALL v5.18 preserved: 10 hops, 499 tests, 18 classes, all validators\n✓ BatchedQAValidator: ✓ INTACT\n✓ ImmutableStagingBuffer: ✓ INTACT\n✓ GateDecisionEngine: ✓ INTACT\n✓ ArtistGenerator: ✓ INTACT\n✓ FileRenderer: ✓ INTACT\n✓ ClerkExtractor: ✓ INTACT\n✓ DataEnricher: ✓ INTACT\n✓ HallucinationDetector: ✓ INTACT\n✓ DuplicateDetector: ✓ INTACT\n✓ VerbCanonicalizer: ✓ INTACT\n✓ TextSanitizer: ✓ INTACT\n✓ PreFlightValidator: ✓ INTACT\n✓ EnhancedQuantitativeValidator: ✓ INTACT\n✓ All dataclasses: ✓ INTACT\n✓ All enums: ✓ INTACT\n✓ All exceptions: ✓ INTACT\n✓ Output: 6 files (Resume, Skills, Cover Letter, Word Table, QA Report, App Tracker)\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.18 (October 2025):\n✓ QA Report: DESTRUCTIVE OVERWRITE - 13 sections → 8 sections (signal-first priority)\n✓ Section 1: Signal Quality & RAG Performance with ASCII bar charts (100 chars = 100%)\n  - Overall signal score with bar visualization\n  - Per-section signal distribution (Headline, Exec Summary, Unify, IBM, TraderSense, EY)\n  - Weighted signal score breakdown\n  - Competitive intelligence (top differentiators, theme alignment)\n✓ Section 2: Industry-First & Thematic Compliance\n✓ Section 3: Content Authenticity (quantitative claims, hallucination checks)\n✓ Section 4: AI Detection Defense\n✓ Section 5: Pipeline Health (all 10 hops: HOP-0 through HOP-8 + HOP-4.5)\n✓ Section 6: Word Count Compliance (consolidated from old sections 2, 3, 4)\n✓ Section 7: Structural & Formatting (deduplication, bullets, hyphenation)\n✓ Section 8: Production Readiness (critical failures, pass rate, final status)\n✓ Removed: Trivial validations (filename standalone, K.7 formatting, redundant word counts)\n✓ Priority: Signal/temperature optimization > word counting bureaucracy\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.17 (October 2025):\n✓ SaaS Roles: Updated to use SaaS_Roles_v3.json (attached file)\n✓ All v5.16 functionality preserved\n✓ No changes to output count, logic, or constraints\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.16 (October 2025):\n✓ Master Resume: Destructive overwrite with V2.15 (from V2.14)\n  - Updated mock master resume fallback data with actual V2.15 schema\n  - Changed file reference from Master_Resume_V2_14.json to Master_Resume_V2_15.json\n  - Full bullet_pool arrays for Unify and IBM roles\n  - Updated owner contact info, education, certifications, and competencies\n✓ Note: SaaS_Roles_v3.json provided but not embedded (script uses external file reference)\n✓ No functional changes to engine logic or constraints\n✓ Data refresh only - all v5.15 logic preserved\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.15 (October 2025):\n✓ Competencies constraints: Bullet words ±20% of master resume avg per bullet\n✓ Optimization: Maximize signal while maintaining highest possible temperature\n✓ Overwrite: Replaced all previous competencies constraints with new spec\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.14 (October 2025):\n✓ Output 4: Complete rewrite using v4.4.4 structure (17 sections + total)\n✓ Added 5th column: "Comment" (max 5 words explaining variance rationale)\n✓ All 17 sections from v4.4.4: Name, Headline, Contact, Exec Summary, all role sections\n✓ Baseline metrics preserved from v4.4.4 SECTION_BASELINES\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.12 (October 2025):\n✓ Reordered: Output 4 = Word Table, Output 5 = QA Report (swapped positions)\n✓ Final order: Resume, Skills, Cover Letter, Word Table, QA Report, App Tracker\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.8 (October 2025):\n✓ Output 5: Application tracker with all 56 App_Schema_v4 fields populated\n✓ Auto-populated: Company, Job Title, Application Date, Base/Versioned Resume\n✓ All remaining fields ready for user input\n✓ Validation: Log-only mode (no output blocking)\nNOTE: v5.9 replaces App Tracker + CoC Ledger with single Word Table (4 outputs total)\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.7 (October 2025):\n✓ Section length constraints: TraderSense, EY, Early Career ±10% of master resume words\n✓ Word distribution rules: (Unify + IBM words) = 35-45% of total resume words\n✓ Unify words/IBM words ratio: 1.1 - 1.3\n✓ Signal/temperature optimization: Maximize signal while maintaining highest temperature\n✓ Headline constraints: 60-90 characters, maximized signal and temperature\n✓ Output count: Exactly 5 files (Resume, Cover Letter, QA Report, App Tracker, CoC Ledger)\n✓ Copy requirements: Competencies, education, name, contact info from master resume\n✓ Word counting: Intro sentences + bullets only\n\nPATCH NOTES v5.6 (October 2025):\n✓ K.1 Executive Summary: Expanded range from 118-135 to 100-150 words\n✓ Enhanced RAG signal utilization: Maximum temperature & signal extraction\n✓ Dynamic summary generation leveraging full thematic analysis depth\n✓ Optimized for agentic RAG inputs with competitive intelligence integration\n\nFULL IMPLEMENTATION - ALL 499 TESTS + ALL VALIDATION GATES + 10-HOP ARCHITECTURE\n\nThis version implements EVERY feature from Job_Workflow v1.9.2:\n✓ 10-Hop Architecture (HOP-0 through HOP-8 + HOP-4.5)\n✓ 499 Comprehensive Tests (100% pass rate required)\n✓ 20+ Validation Gates (all v1.8.2 + v1.9.2 enhancements)\n✓ Feedback Loop (HOP-3 with 5 regeneration attempts)\n✓ Immutable Staging Buffer (locked after HOP-4.5)\n✓ Scope Isolation (artist_output + master_resume deletion)\n✓ Text Sanitization (Hyphenation_Rules.json from v1.9.2)\n✓ Gate Decision Logic (PROCEED vs ERROR_REPORT_ONLY)\n✓ Read-Back Verification (hash validation + rollback)\n✓ Hallucination Detection (HOP-1)\n✓ Enhanced Quantitative Validation (v1.9.2)\n✓ Industry Adjacency Validation (v1.9.2)\n✓ Complete K.0 RAG with peer JD retrieval\n✓ Complete HOP-2 data enrichment (verb canonicalization, duplicate detection)\n✓ 8-Section QA Report (Signal-First Priority)\n✓ 6 Output Files (Resume, Skills, Cover Letter, Word Table, QA Report, App Tracker)\n✓ Hash Chain Audit Trail (H0→H1→...→H8)\n\nPLUS all v5.4 enhancements:\n✓ Signal elasticity models\n✓ Coherence scoring\n✓ Per-section tolerance configs\n\nVersion: 5.23\nDate: January 2025  \nArchitecture: Job_Workflow v1.9.2 + All v5.21 + v5.22 + v5.23 Cosine Similarity\nOutput Files: 6 (Resume, Skills, Cover Letter, Word Table, QA Report, App Tracker)\n')),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='json')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='re')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='hashlib')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='math')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Tuple'),
        alias(name='Optional'),
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Set')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='enum',
      names=[
        alias(name='Enum')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='datetime',
      names=[
        alias(name='datetime')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field'),
        alias(name='asdict')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='pathlib',
      names=[
        alias(name='Path')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='copy')]),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='__version__', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='5.23')),
    ClassDef(
      name='JDParser',
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='\n    Parse job description into structured analysis.\n    NO MOCK DATA - all extracted from actual JD text.\n    ')),
        FunctionDef(
          name='__init__',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self'),
              arg(
                arg='jd_text',
                annotation=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()))]),
          body=[
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='jd_text',
                  ctx=Store())],
              value=Name(id='jd_text', ctx=Load())),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='parsed',
                  ctx=Store())],
              value=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='_parse',
                  ctx=Load())))]),
        FunctionDef(
          name='_parse',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self')]),
          body=[
            Expr(
              value=Constant(value='Extract structured data from JD.')),
            Return(
              value=Dict(
                keys=[
                  Constant(value='primary_theme'),
                  Constant(value='secondary_themes'),
                  Constant(value='required_skills'),
                  Constant(value='preferred_skills'),
                  Constant(value='role_classification'),
                  Constant(value='competitive_intelligence'),
                  Constant(value='key_responsibilities'),
                  Constant(value='qualifications'),
                  Constant(value='company_context'),
                  Constant(value='seniority_signals'),
                  Constant(value='industry_vertical')],
                values=[
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_primary_theme',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_secondary_themes',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_required_skills',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_preferred_skills',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_classify_role',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_analyze_competitive_landscape',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_responsibilities',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_qualifications',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_company_context',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_seniority_signals',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='_extract_industry_vertical',
                      ctx=Load()))]))],
          returns=Name(id='Dict', ctx=Load())),
        FunctionDef(
          name='_extract_primary_theme',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self')]),
          body=[
            Expr(
              value=Constant(value='Extract primary role theme from JD.')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Store())],
              value=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Attribute(
                    value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                    attr='jd_text',
                    ctx=Load()),
                  attr='lower',
                  ctx=Load()))),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='role_patterns', ctx=Store())],
              value=Dict(
                keys=[
                  Constant(value='pre-sales'),
                  Constant(value='engineering'),
                  Constant(value='ai_ml'),
                  Constant(value='product'),
                  Constant(value='sales'),
                  Constant(value='leadership'),
                  Constant(value='operations'),
                  Constant(value='customer_success')],
                values=[
                  Constant(value='pre[-\\s]?sales|solutions? engineer|sales engineer|technical sales'),
                  Constant(value='engineering|software|development|architect(?!ure sales)'),
                  Constant(value='\\bai\\b|machine learning|\\bml\\b|artificial intelligence|data science'),
                  Constant(value='product management|product owner|product strategy'),
                  Constant(value='\\bsales\\b|account executive|business development'),
                  Constant(value='vp|vice president|director|head of|chief'),
                  Constant(value='operations|ops|platform|infrastructure'),
                  Constant(value='customer success|account management|customer experience')])),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='level_patterns', ctx=Store())],
              value=Dict(
                keys=[
                  Constant(value='executive'),
                  Constant(value='director'),
                  Constant(value='manager'),
                  Constant(value='senior')],
                values=[
                  Constant(value='vp|vice president|svp|evp|chief|c-level|executive'),
                  Constant(value='director|head of'),
                  Constant(value='manager|lead|principal'),
                  Constant(value='senior|staff|principal')])),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='role_type', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value=None)),
            For(
              target=Tuple(
                elts=[
                  Name(id='rtype', ctx=Store()),
                  Name(id='pattern', ctx=Store())],
                ctx=Store()),
              iter=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='role_patterns', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='items',
                  ctx=Load())),
              body=[
                If(
                  test=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='search',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                      Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Load())]),
                  body=[
                    Assign(
                      targets=[
                        Name(id='role_type', ctx=Store())],
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Call(
                            func=Attribute(
                              value=Name(id='rtype', ctx=Load()),
                              attr='replace',
                              ctx=Load()),
                            args=[
                              Constant(value='_'),
                              Constant(value=' ')]),
                          attr='title',
                          ctx=Load()))),
                    Break()])]),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='level', ctx=Store())],
              value=Constant(value=None)),
            For(
              target=Tuple(
                elts=[
                  Name(id='lvl', ctx=Store()),
                  Name(id='pattern', ctx=Store())],
                ctx=Store()),
              iter=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='level_patterns', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='items',
                  ctx=Load())),
              body=[
                If(
                  test=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='search',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                      Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Load())]),
                  body=[
                    Assign(
                      targets=[
                        Name(id='level', ctx=Store())],
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Name(id='lvl', ctx=Load()),
                          attr='title',
                          ctx=Load()))),
                    Break()])]),
            If(
              test=BoolOp(
                op=And(),
                values=[
                  Name(id='role_type', ctx=Load()),
                  Name(id='level', ctx=Load())]),
              body=[
                Return(
                  value=JoinedStr(
                    values=[
                      FormattedValue(
                        value=Name(id='level', ctx=Load()),
                        conversion=-1),
                      Constant(value=' '),
                      FormattedValue(
                        value=Name(id='role_type', ctx=Load()),
                        conversion=-1),
                      Constant(value=' Leadership')]))],
              orelse=[
                If(
                  test=Name(id='role_type', ctx=Load()),
                  body=[
                    Return(
                      value=JoinedStr(
                        values=[
                          FormattedValue(
                            value=Name(id='role_type', ctx=Load()),
                            conversion=-1),
                          Constant(value=' Leadership')]))],
                  orelse=[
                    Return(
                      value=Constant(value='Technology Leadership'))])])],
          returns=Name(id='str', ctx=Load())),
        FunctionDef(
          name='_extract_secondary_themes',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self')]),
          body=[
            Expr(
              value=Constant(value='Extract 3-5 secondary themes from JD.')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='themes', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(ctx=Load())),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Store())],
              value=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Attribute(
                    value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                    attr='jd_text',
                    ctx=Load()),
                  attr='lower',
                  ctx=Load()))),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='theme_patterns', ctx=Store())],
              value=Dict(
                keys=[
                  Constant(value='Team Building'),
                  Constant(value='Customer Success'),
                  Constant(value='Strategy'),
                  Constant(value='Technical Expertise'),
                  Constant(value='Revenue Growth'),
                  Constant(value='AI/ML'),
                  Constant(value='Cloud'),
                  Constant(value='Enterprise Sales'),
                  Constant(value='Product'),
                  Constant(value='Transformation'),
                  Constant(value='Scalability'),
                  Constant(value='Collaboration')],
                values=[
                  Constant(value='team|hiring|talent|people|organization|staff'),
                  Constant(value='customer|client|account|relationship|partnership'),
                  Constant(value='strategy|strategic|vision|roadmap|planning'),
                  Constant(value='technical|architecture|solution|design|implementation'),
                  Constant(value='revenue|sales|growth|pipeline|quota|target'),
                  Constant(value='\\bai\\b|machine learning|\\bml\\b|artificial intelligence'),
                  Constant(value='cloud|aws|azure|gcp|saas|paas'),
                  Constant(value='enterprise|b2b|fortune|large accounts'),
                  Constant(value='product|platform|software|application'),
                  Constant(value='transformation|modernization|digital|innovation'),
                  Constant(value='scale|scaling|growth|expansion'),
                  Constant(value='collaboration|cross-functional|stakeholder|partnership')])),
            For(
              target=Tuple(
                elts=[
                  Name(id='theme', ctx=Store()),
                  Name(id='pattern', ctx=Store())],
                ctx=Store()),
              iter=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='theme_patterns', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='items',
                  ctx=Load())),
              body=[
                If(
                  test=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='search',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                      Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Load())]),
                  body=[
                    Expr(
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Name(id='themes', ctx=Load()),
                          attr='append',
                          ctx=Load()),
                        args=[
                          Name(id='theme', ctx=Load())]))])]),
            Return(
              value=Subscript(
                value=Name(id='themes', ctx=Load()),
                slice=Slice(
                  upper=Constant(value=5)),
                ctx=Load()))],
          returns=Subscript(
            value=Name(id='List', ctx=Load()),
            slice=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()),
            ctx=Load())),
        FunctionDef(
          name='_extract_required_skills',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self')]),
          body=[
            Expr(
              value=Constant(value='Extract required technical and business skills.')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='skills', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(ctx=Load())),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Store())],
              value=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Attribute(
                    value=Name(id='self', ctx=Load()),
                    attr='jd_text',
                    ctx=Load()),
                  attr='lower',
                  ctx=Load()))),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='tech_patterns', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(
                elts=[
                  Constant(value='\\b(python|java|javascript|typescript|c\\+\\+|golang|ruby|scala)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(aws|azure|gcp|kubernetes|docker|terraform|ansible)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(sql|nosql|postgresql|mongodb|redis|elasticsearch)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(ml|ai|machine learning|deep learning|nlp|computer vision)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(api|rest|microservices|cloud-native)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(ci/cd|devops|jenkins|gitlab|github actions)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(spark|hadoop|kafka|airflow|snowflake|databricks)\\b'),
                  Constant(value='\\b(react|angular|vue|node\\.js|django|flask)\\b')],
                ctx=Load())),
            For(
              target=Name(id='pattern', ctx=Store()),
              iter=Name(id='tech_patterns', ctx=Load()),
              body=[
                Assign(
                  targets=[
                    Name(id='matches', ctx=Store())],
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='finditer',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                      Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Load())])),
                Expr(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='skills', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='extend',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      ListComp(
                        elt=Call(
                          func=Attribute(
                            value=Call(
                              func=Attribute(
                                value=Name(id='m', ctx=Load()),
                                attr='group',
                                ctx=Load()),
                              args=[
                                Constant(value=0)]),
                            attr='upper',
                            ctx=Load())),
                        generators=[
                          comprehension(
                            target=Name(id='m', ctx=Store()),
                            iter=Name(id='matches', ctx=Load()),
                            is_async=0)])]))]),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='business_patterns', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(
                elts=[
                  Constant(value='leadership'),
                  Constant(value='management'),
                  Constant(value='strategy'),
                  Constant(value='communication'),
                  Constant(value='collaboration'),
                  Constant(value='problem[-\\s]?solving'),
                  Constant(value='analytical'),
                  Constant(value='customer[-\\s]?facing'),
                  Constant(value='stakeholder'),
                  Constant(value='executive presence'),
                  Constant(value='p&l|p\\&l|profit and loss'),
                  Constant(value='budget'),
                  Constant(value='forecasting'),
                  Constant(value='negotiation'),
                  Constant(value='presentation'),
                  Constant(value='influence')],
                ctx=Load())),
            For(
              target=Name(id='pattern', ctx=Store()),
              iter=Name(id='business_patterns', ctx=Load()),
              body=[
                If(
                  test=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='search',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                      Name(id='jd_lower', ctx=Load())]),
                  body=[
                    Assign(
                      targets=[
                        Name(id='skill_name', ctx=Store())],
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Call(
                            func=Attribute(
                              value=Call(
                                func=Attribute(
                                  value=Name(id='pattern', ctx=Load()),
                                  attr='replace',
                                  ctx=Load()),
                                args=[
                                  Constant(value='[-\\s]?'),
                                  Constant(value=' ')]),
                              attr='replace',
                              ctx=Load()),
                            args=[
